{'symbol': 'OTIS', 'date': '2022-04-22 16:06:00', 'title': 'OTIS ANNOUNCES A 20.8 PERCENT INCREASE IN QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO $0.29 PER SHARE', 'text': "FARMINGTON, CONN. , APRIL 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE OTIS WORLDWIDE CORPORATION (NYSE: OTIS) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.29 PER SHARE OF OTIS' COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS A 20.8% INCREASE."}